From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000013 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
Subject: [PATCH] steering: acknowledge and complete BTM report

The controller receives Client Steering BTM Reports but does not send the
required 1905 ACK: the existing ACK call is commented out.  The agent therefore
re-sends the same report until orchestration times out.

Send the ACK with the received MID and source AL MAC, retain the report MID on
the sending radio, route the ACK back to that pending radio, and return the
agent state to configured when the matching ACK arrives.  Limit BTM-report
orchestration to the radio that owns the source BSS; the shared data model can
otherwise make the same STA appear on every radio and leave unrelated
candidates pending until timeout.
---
diff --git a/inc/em_steering.h b/inc/em_steering.h
--- a/inc/em_steering.h
+++ b/inc/em_steering.h
@@ -25,6 +25,7 @@
 
     unsigned int m_client_steering_req_tx_cnt;
     unsigned short m_client_steering_req_msg_id;
+    unsigned short m_btm_report_msg_id;
     em_state_t m_client_steering_prev_state;
     unsigned int m_client_assoc_ctrl_req_tx_cnt;
 
@@ -106,7 +107,7 @@
 	 * @note Ensure that the MAC address is valid and the station is reachable
 	 * before calling this function.
 	 */
-	int send_1905_ack_message(mac_addr_t sta_mac, unsigned short msg_id, unsigned char reason = 0, unsigned char *dst = nullptr);
+	int send_1905_ack_message(mac_addr_t sta_mac, unsigned short msg_id, unsigned char reason = 0, unsigned char *dst = nullptr, unsigned char *src = nullptr);
     
 	/**!
 	 * @brief Handles the client steering request.
@@ -330,6 +331,8 @@
 	void set_client_steering_req_tx_count(unsigned int cnt) { m_client_steering_req_tx_cnt = cnt; }
 	void set_client_steering_req_msg_id(unsigned short msg_id) { m_client_steering_req_msg_id = msg_id; }
 	unsigned short get_client_steering_req_msg_id() { return m_client_steering_req_msg_id; }
+	void set_btm_report_msg_id(unsigned short msg_id) { m_btm_report_msg_id = msg_id; }
+	unsigned short get_btm_report_msg_id() { return m_btm_report_msg_id; }
 	void set_client_steering_prev_state(em_state_t state) { m_client_steering_prev_state = state; }
 	em_state_t get_client_steering_prev_state() { return m_client_steering_prev_state; }
     
